<?php foreach(['all','guests','users','role'] as $v):?><option value="<?=e($v)?>" <?=($editPopup['audience']??'all')===$v?'selected':''?>><?=e(ucfirst($v))?></option><?php endforeach;?></select></div><div><label>Role</label><select class="input" name="target_role"><option value="">Any</option><?php foreach(core_role_registry() as $v=>$r):?><option value="<?=e($v)?>" <?=($editPopup['target_role']??'')===$v?'selected':''?>><?=e($r['label'])?></option><?php endforeach;?></select></div><div><label>Repeat</label><select class="input" name="repeat_policy"><option value="once_session">Once / session</option><option value="once_day">Once / day</option><option value="every_visit">Every visit</option></select></div><div><label>Starts</label><input class="input" type="datetime-local" name="starts_at" value="<?=e(!empty($editPopup['starts_at'])?date('Y-m-d\TH:i',strtotime($editPopup['starts_at'])):'')?>"></div><div><label>Ends</label><input class="input" type="datetime-local" name="ends_at" value="<?=e(!empty($editPopup['ends_at'])?date('Y-m-d\TH:i',strtotime($editPopup['ends_at'])):'')?>"></div></div><label>Action Label</label><input class="input" name="action_label" value="<?=e($editPopup['action_label']??'')?>"><label>Action URL</label><input class="input" name="action_url" value="<?=e($editPopup['action_url']??'')?>"><label>Priority</label><input class="input" type="number" name="priority" value="<?=e($editPopup['priority']??10)?>"><label><input type="checkbox" name="enabled" <?=($editPopup['enabled']??1)?'checked':''?>> Enabled</label><button class="btn">Save Campaign</button></form></aside></div>
<?php else:?><div class="lca-main"><section class="card"><div class="lca-head"><h3>Notification History</h3></div><div class="lca-table"><table><tr><th>Notification</th><th>Target</th><th>Status</th><th>Reads</th><th>Action</th></tr><?php foreach($notifs as $n):?><tr><td><b><?=e($n['icon'].' '.$n['title'])?></b><br><small><?=e(mb_strimwidth((string)$n['body'],0,90,'…'))?></small></td><td><?=e($n['target_type'])?> <?=e($n['target_role']?:$n['target_user_name'])?></td><td><?=e($n['status'])?></td><td><?=e($n['read_count'])?></td><td><form method="post" onsubmit="return confirm('Delete notification?')"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<?=e(csrf_token())?>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="delete_notification"><input type="hidden" name="id" value="<?=e($n['id'])?>"><button class="link-danger">Delete</button></form></td></tr><?php endforeach;?></table></div></section><aside class="card lca-editor"><h3>Send Notification</h3><form method="post"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<?=e(csrf_token())?>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="save_notification"><label>Title</label><input class="input" name="title" required><label>Message</label><textarea class="input" rows="4" name="body"></textarea><div class="lca-form-grid"><div><label>Type</label><select class="input" name="notification_type"><option value="info">Info</option><option value="success">Success</option><option value="warning">Warning</option><option value="promotion">Promotion</option></select></div><div><label>Target</label><select class="input" name="target_type"><option value="all">All users</option><option value="role">Role</option><option value="user">Specific user</option></select></div><div><label>Role</label><select class="input" name="target_role"><option value="">None</option><?php foreach(core_role_registry() as $v=>$r):?><option value="<?=e($v)?>"><?=e($r['label'])?></option><?php endforeach;?></select></div><div><label>User</label><select class="input" name="target_user_id